B.Ol=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_01.jpg","THE BEGINNING","A small moment that became important","This is our first memory together, we easily found ourselves in each other's company. I knew I wanted to remember this day forever.",-0.035)
B.Om=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_02.jpg","A RANDOM DAY","One of my favorite smiles","Your smile is the most beautiful thing I have ever seen. It makes me feel like I am home.",0.028)
B.Og=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_03.jpg","LITTLE THINGS","The kind of memory I keep replaying",'That morning, when I said "I miss you" and you replied "I miss you too", I felt like the world stopped for a moment. It was a small thing, but it meant everything to me.',-0.02)
B.Oj=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_04.jpg","ANOTHER CHAPTER","Somehow, you made this day warmer","It's like we didn't care about the rain, the cold, or the wind. We just wanted to be together and enjoy the moment.",0.045)
B.On=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_05.jpg","ONE OF MY FAVORITES","A photo I never get tired of","Only if you know how much I love this photo. It's a reminder of how lucky I am to have you in my life.",-0.03)
B.Oh=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_06.jpg","TIRA MISS U","Proof that the best memories are rarely planned","It's not the bouquet, the dress, or the location that makes a memory special. It's you, your presence, and the way you make me feel that makes every moment unforgettable.",0.025)
B.Ok=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_07.jpg","MORE TO COME","I hope we make a lot more of these","If I could, I would freeze this moment in time and keep it forever. But I know that the best memories are the ones we create together, and I can't wait to make more with you.",-0.04)
B.Oi=new A.iI("assets/images/photo_08.jpg","TODAY","Happy birthday, beautiful","Thanks for being the best part of my life. I hope this beautiful day is just the beginning of a year filled with happiness, love, and all the things that make you smile.",0.018)
